      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "L1  Host reachability\nPing matrix run from the 10 hosts\n58 allowed pairs + 32 guest pairs that must fail\n8.8.8.8 and 1.1.1.1 from every host\nFailed pair retried once: pass on retry = flaky",
